{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Midnight Survivors</strong> is a game where you survive waves of enemies by sweeping them away with firepower until the very end. It combines the elements of traditional bullet hell roguelike shooters with defense mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195510/extras/422de31f68ea6566af9d5a8faf5526ab.poster.avif?t=1746087802\" width=504 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195510/extras/422de31f68ea6566af9d5a8faf5526ab.webm?t=1746087802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195510/extras/422de31f68ea6566af9d5a8faf5526ab.mp4?t=1746087802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195510/extras/9a550ae9c1e4f1749dd31710359b60a7.poster.avif?t=1746087802\" width=504 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195510/extras/9a550ae9c1e4f1749dd31710359b60a7.webm?t=1746087802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195510/extras/9a550ae9c1e4f1749dd31710359b60a7.mp4?t=1746087802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet 6 different cats.</strong><br>Defend the village and survive using cats, each equipped with unique weapons and overdrive shots.h equipped with unique weapons and overdrive shots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195510/extras/c8eac55484f22dad627bc1fd23ac31e5.poster.avif?t=1746087802\" width=530 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195510/extras/c8eac55484f22dad627bc1fd23ac31e5.webm?t=1746087802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195510/extras/c8eac55484f22dad627bc1fd23ac31e5.mp4?t=1746087802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Between waves, use the money you've earned to buy and place turrets or plant mines.</strong><br>As the waves increase, enemies become stronger and more numerous, but your cats will also grow stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195510/extras/a68d33752f49eaeacc26a6530a0b4e1c.poster.avif?t=1746087802\" width=504 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195510/extras/a68d33752f49eaeacc26a6530a0b4e1c.webm?t=1746087802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195510/extras/a68d33752f49eaeacc26a6530a0b4e1c.mp4?t=1746087802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hatch eggs and gain allies.</strong><br>Hatch eggs found in chests to recruit allies and defeat enemies together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195510/extras/ee1eb90d1f3ba7f3552c2c9d05c02526.poster.avif?t=1746087802\" width=504 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195510/extras/ee1eb90d1f3ba7f3552c2c9d05c02526.